  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 304.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 304.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish requirements for the use of bulk water as an emergency source of water by public water systems (PWS).\n\nSource. #9577, eff 10-23-09; ss by #12444, eff 1-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw300.html"
